{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigating the line between moral right and wrong grows increasingly tricky when you\u2019re struggling to survive after leaving your corporate job, torn between competing desires that pull you in different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a fledgling indie game developer crafting a romantic visual novel, you must not only finish the project but also juggle your relationships with friends. You\u2019ll need to be there for them\u2014offering support, providing comfort during their hardships, and perhaps igniting a steamy romance that could upend everything\u2026 with unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To launch your game, you\u2019ll need assistance. Lacking skills in art, music, or marketing, you\u2019ll have to lean on your friends for help. But how much are you willing to push them to get what you need? And what will you give in return for their support?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_chloe.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_lalana.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_sonia.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_erica.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lives of these four women become deeply entangled throughout the story, with Daniel at the center of it all. Your choices will shape everything - will you break things off with Sonia and remain loyal to John, or explore a deeper connection with Chloe and share an intimate moment with both of them while Sonia\u2019s away? Perhaps you\u2019ll fall under Lalana\u2019s spell, letting her take you in front of John and Sonia\u2026 before things spiral into partner-swapping temptation. And then there\u2019s Erica - mysterious, magnetic. What hidden kinks lie beneath that twisted mind of hers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/rmx-open-1.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a gameplay perspective, it\u2019s a blend of classic adventure mechanics and visual novel storytelling. You\u2019ll explore the map, uncover new locations, engage in meaningful conversations, and make impactful choices - all while diving into emotionally charged scenes. No grinding, no stat-building, no repetitive tasks - just pure, story-driven fun from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/rmx-open-3.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a significant visual leap beyond anything we\u2019ve released before. Expect stunning 4K visuals, ultra-detailed high-resolution character models, and meticulously designed custom locations. The animations are more immersive than ever, featuring cinematic angles that let you see the world directly through the eyes of the main character, pulling you deeper into every moment.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354190?t=1743174573","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/e5ff3fdcd71b33b04e1266f11ecc07207d72a9f6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743174573","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/1106eda7874b5c9d4e024b82cbfb97a37f16def2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743174573","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/1106eda7874b5c9d4e024b82cbfb97a37f16def2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743174573","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Consensual sexual activities between individuals of different genders, including group encounters involving three or more participants. All depicted with tastefulness and respect."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigating the line between moral right and wrong grows increasingly tricky when you\u2019re struggling to survive after leaving your corporate job, torn between competing desires that pull you in different directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a fledgling indie game developer crafting a romantic visual novel, you must not only finish the project but also juggle your relationships with friends. You\u2019ll need to be there for them\u2014offering support, providing comfort during their hardships, and perhaps igniting a steamy romance that could upend everything\u2026 with unexpected consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To launch your game, you\u2019ll need assistance. Lacking skills in art, music, or marketing, you\u2019ll have to lean on your friends for help. But how much are you willing to push them to get what you need? And what will you give in return for their support?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_chloe.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_lalana.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_sonia.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/prev_erica.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The lives of these four women become deeply entangled throughout the story, with Daniel at the center of it all. Your choices will shape everything - will you break things off with Sonia and remain loyal to John, or explore a deeper connection with Chloe and share an intimate moment with both of them while Sonia\u2019s away? Perhaps you\u2019ll fall under Lalana\u2019s spell, letting her take you in front of John and Sonia\u2026 before things spiral into partner-swapping temptation. And then there\u2019s Erica - mysterious, magnetic. What hidden kinks lie beneath that twisted mind of hers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/rmx-open-1.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a gameplay perspective, it\u2019s a blend of classic adventure mechanics and visual novel storytelling. You\u2019ll explore the map, uncover new locations, engage in meaningful conversations, and make impactful choices - all while diving into emotionally charged scenes. No grinding, no stat-building, no repetitive tasks - just pure, story-driven fun from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/rmx-open-3.jpg?t=1743174573\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get ready for a significant visual leap beyond anything we\u2019ve released before. Expect stunning 4K visuals, ultra-detailed high-resolution character models, and meticulously designed custom locations. The animations are more immersive than ever, featuring cinematic angles that let you see the world directly through the eyes of the main character, pulling you deeper into every moment.</p>","developers":["Lesson of Passion"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/f7a54a65c96f18f53a935ac0f7d50aa9ef996677/header.jpg?t=1743174573","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest version<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest version<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Both Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Both Apple Silicon and Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117163,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117163/movie480.mp4?t=1742551997","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117163/movie_max.mp4?t=1742551997"},"name":"rmx-tease","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25711